      "body": "Down from ₹3,786, the current price target is an average from 25 analysts. New target price is 14% above last closing price of ₹3,055. Stock is down 2.1% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹90.93 for next year compared to ₹109 last year.",
